    "title": "Baseball Tournament Brackets Out for 1A and 2A - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sam Heyn ,\n12 hours ago Tournament brackets are out for Class 1A and 2A baseball. Area teams in Class 1A have been assigned to District 1 in Substate 1 as well as District 4 in Substate 2. Area teams in Class 2A find themselves in either District 1 or 2 in Substate 1. Unity Christian is the exception, having been assigned to District 15 in Substate 8. Read full article",
